        "scope": "in_scope",
        "statement": "Let $\\mathcal D=\\{1\\}\\cup\\{(\\ph(w)+1)/|w|:\\ |w|\\geq1,\\ w\\text{ is not TAS}\\}$\nand $L=\\inf\\mathcal D$. Then\n\\[\n \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{f(n)}n=L,\n \\qquad \\frac1{1665}\\leq L\\leq\\frac9{19},\n \\qquad \\frac{f(n)}n\\geq L-\\frac1n\\quad(n\\geq1).\n\\]\nMore explicitly, suppose $w$ has length $k\\geq1$, $r=\\ph(w)$, and\n$q=2^kt(w,T)>1$ in an $N$-vertex tournament. Then $N\\geq2$. Put\n\\begin{equation}\n c=\\frac{N-1}{N},\\qquad\n M=1+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{k\\log(1/c)}{\\log q}\\right\\rfloor.\n\\end{equation}\nFor every $n\\geq2kM$ there is a non-TAS word of length $n$ in this same $T$, and\n\\begin{equation}\n \\frac{f(n)}n\\leq\\frac{r+1}{k}+\\frac{2k}{n}.\n\\end{equation}",
        "status": "preparing",
